# Dogfood run logs: bug write-ups, dead ends, and the workspace/document IDs of the
# builds they came from. They are PleaseREST's build record, not its documentation.
dogfood/

# Machine-local Claude Code state — at every level, including please-rest/.claude/.
# settings.local.json is pre-approved tool permissions (machine-specific, and a footgun for
# anyone who clones); launch.json is a local run config with absolute paths. Neither is read
# when the plugin is installed — the same rule pr-gh-package gives generated plugins.
.claude/
settings.local.json

